---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import GardenCTA from '../../components/GardenCTA.astro';
import StackCards from '../../components/StackCards.astro';
import HoneyWaves from '../../components/HoneyWaves.astro';
---
<Base hideGarden={true} title="1:1 Mentoring | The Soul Mami" description="One-on-one mentoring with Eliana Reyes. Untangle the loops, alchemize the emotions, and rebuild your self-trust, with a guide who walks beside you.">

  <!-- Beat: Invitation -->
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="wrap grid-2" style="align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">1:1 · You and Me</span>
        <h1>Mentoring for the <em class="soul">real you</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Not coaching-by-formula. Not therapy. A real conversation
          with someone who's gone through it, where we take off the
          layers that were never yours and rebuild your trust in the
          one person you can't leave: you.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <!-- TODO: replace with Eliana's booking link (Calendly or similar) -->
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/lets-talk/">Start the conversation</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#what">What we work on</a>
        </div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">No pitch. No pressure. Just a conversation to see if we fit.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="photo photo--arch" src="/images/eliana-river.jpg" alt="Eliana standing peacefully in a river, eyes closed, hand to her heart" fetchpriority="high" style="max-height:460px;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- From here down, each section stacks over the last like a card. -->
  <div class="stack">

  <!-- Beat: Reality -->
  <section class="section section--sand" id="what">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Work</span>
      <h2>What we actually work on</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        You bring what's real. I bring a life fully lived,
        200+ circles of practice, and a very high tolerance for the
        emotional deep end.
      </p>
      <ul class="work-list">
        <li><strong>The loops.</strong> The repeating patterns of doubt, shrinking, and self-abandonment. We find where they started and what they're protecting.</li>
        <li><strong>The layers.</strong> The identities you've been performing that were never yours. We take them off one at a time, with respect for why you put them on.</li>
        <li><strong>The emotions.</strong> I'm an emotional alchemist. Bring me any feeling and we'll transmute it and get the lesson. Nothing you carry is too much.</li>
        <li><strong>The expression.</strong> There's stuff only you came here to say and make. We get it out of your head and into the world.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Process -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose center" style="margin-inline:auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Path</span>
        <h2>How it works</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <h3>We talk</h3>
          <p>A no-pressure conversation. You tell me what's alive for you; we both feel out whether this is a fit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <h3>We commit</h3>
          <!-- TODO: session format, cadence, package options, and pricing from Eliana -->
          <p>We shape the container together: cadence, focus, and the honest agreements that make deep work possible.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <h3>We go</h3>
          <p>Session by session, you come back to yourself. Less performing, more expressing. Less loop, more life.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Proof -->
  <section class="section witnessed">
    <HoneyWaves />
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose center" style="margin-inline:auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Witnessed</span>
        <h2>Words from people I've walked with</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:2.5rem; max-width: 60rem; margin-inline:auto;">
        <figure class="card quote">
          <blockquote>
            <p>"I said no two times today because I felt it in my gut, like you said I do, that it was a no for me. I went back and forth with my mind coming up with reasons why I could do something when I didn't want to at all. This insight you gave me is truly the gift that keeps on giving."</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>1:1 client</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="card quote">
          <blockquote>
            <p>"Thank you SO much for being you. You helped me click back in and anchor. Deeply needed. I'm already feeling refreshed."</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>1:1 client</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Timing -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Timing</span>
      <h2>When people usually come to me</h2>
      <ol class="timing-list">
        <li><strong>01 · The quiet crisis.</strong> Everything looks fine on paper and feels hollow in your chest.</li>
        <li><strong>02 · The threshold.</strong> A breakup, a career shift, a loss: an ending that's secretly an invitation.</li>
        <li><strong>03 · The overflow.</strong> Emotions running the show, and you're tired of outrunning them.</li>
        <li><strong>04 · The whisper.</strong> Something in you wants to be expressed (a project, a change, a truth), and it's getting louder.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>If one of those made your stomach flip a little: that's the one. Reach out.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/lets-talk/">Start the conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <GardenCTA />

  </div>
  <StackCards />

</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--honey);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .work-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .work-list li {
    padding: 0.85rem 0 0.85rem 1.9rem;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sand-deep);
  }
  .work-list li::before {
    content: "✦";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--honey);
  }
  .timing-list { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; padding: 0; }
  .timing-list li { padding-block: 0.7rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sand-deep); }
</style>
